WEBVTT

00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:02.360
What happened?

00:02:06.440 --> 00:02:07.930
That's the blue sky?

00:02:09.270 --> 00:02:12.180
It's creepy somehow, isn't it?

00:02:17.420 --> 00:02:19.440
<i>Extra! Extra!</i>

00:02:39.100 --> 00:02:41.070
<i>The sky! Look at...</i>

00:02:41.610 --> 00:02:43.170
<i>The blue sky sure is better.</i>

00:02:43.170 --> 00:02:44.900
<i>That's the truth!</i>

00:03:19.380 --> 00:03:22.750
Blue... It's a strange color.

00:03:22.750 --> 00:03:27.310
I'd seen it in photos, but it's creepy when you see it for real.

00:03:38.630 --> 00:03:39.820
<i>I'm sorry!</i>

00:04:10.460 --> 00:04:11.690
<i>Here we go!</i>

00:04:12.500 --> 00:04:13.500
<i>To the blue sky!</i>

00:04:13.500 --> 00:04:15.660
<i>Cheers!</i>

00:04:17.200 --> 00:04:20.830
Die, all you happy people! Bang!

00:04:30.880 --> 00:04:35.510
It's beautiful. I thought it would be a more ominous color.

00:04:38.560 --> 00:04:39.820
<i>Let's get going.</i>

00:04:45.900 --> 00:04:47.470
Well, well...

00:04:47.470 --> 00:04:50.430
And how are we feeling, ladies?

00:04:53.970 --> 00:04:55.940
It seems she doesn't like me.

00:04:55.940 --> 00:05:00.510
Because of that, it looks like those cockroaches you're so proud of won't be taking the field.

00:05:00.510 --> 00:05:07.650
I believe at some point I'll have the opportunity to show them to you, and to your children.

00:05:11.290 --> 00:05:14.450
I wonder if Fuko is all right?

00:05:14.790 --> 00:05:16.460
Did something happen?

00:05:16.460 --> 00:05:17.890
No...

00:05:18.460 --> 00:05:21.760
Fu doesn't look it, but she's easily hurt, you know.

00:05:23.030 --> 00:05:25.300
I'm going to go look for her.

00:06:12.880 --> 00:06:14.180
Here you go.

00:06:14.690 --> 00:06:15.980
Thanks...

00:06:16.350 --> 00:06:19.150
Oh? Where are Fu and Tatsuya?

00:06:19.890 --> 00:06:21.260
They just...

00:06:22.090 --> 00:06:23.360
I see.

00:06:25.900 --> 00:06:28.030
I'm going home ahead of you.

00:06:28.030 --> 00:06:29.000
Yes, Ma'am.

00:06:30.100 --> 00:06:31.530
Is it all right?

00:06:31.870 --> 00:06:33.170
Is what all right?

00:06:33.170 --> 00:06:37.230
I don't think Gilgamesh have given up on destroying the Turangalila.

00:06:37.980 --> 00:06:39.340
I'm certain that in the near future...

00:06:41.050 --> 00:06:42.210
You're right.

00:06:42.710 --> 00:06:43.550
If so...

00:06:43.550 --> 00:06:46.350
For now, I want to watch our opponents' moves.

00:06:46.350 --> 00:06:48.750
I also don't want to get involved in their battles.

00:06:50.220 --> 00:06:53.780
So, don't all of you be too late getting home either.

00:07:09.840 --> 00:07:11.540
How's it performing?

00:07:11.540 --> 00:07:14.540
Both geomagnetic and atmospheric neutrino levels are fine.

00:07:18.280 --> 00:07:21.250
Dr. Enuma, a message card was delivered.

00:07:26.220 --> 00:07:30.320
<i>When our strength is needed, please call anytime.</i>

00:07:31.430 --> 00:07:35.070
<i>I will respond tolerantly to any womanly changes of heart.</i>

00:07:35.070 --> 00:07:36.690
<i>Hayato Kazamatsuri</i>

00:08:07.970 --> 00:08:11.700
I don't know why everyone's so overjoyed just about the sky's color changing.

00:08:12.300 --> 00:08:15.030
Yeah, nothing's different.

00:08:17.740 --> 00:08:21.040
It's not bothering me or anything, what happened yesterday.

00:08:21.410 --> 00:08:23.280
Yeah...

00:08:24.280 --> 00:08:28.120
I'm a kissing maniac, so that kind of thing is just a greeting.

00:08:30.690 --> 00:08:34.490
I wonder... Is there someone else you like?

00:08:34.830 --> 00:08:35.920
Huh?

00:08:38.430 --> 00:08:40.560
Like Kiyoko or someone?

00:08:54.750 --> 00:08:55.510
It's them.

00:08:55.510 --> 00:08:56.480
Right!

00:09:04.620 --> 00:09:05.590
Below us?!

00:09:10.090 --> 00:09:11.250
Isamu!

00:09:11.430 --> 00:09:12.260
Yeah!

00:09:12.260 --> 00:09:13.250
Here you go.

00:09:24.280 --> 00:09:25.260
You're okay.

00:09:40.790 --> 00:09:43.960
Concentrate the military's security troops in front of Gate 2,

00:09:43.960 --> 00:09:45.830
...and send the Embryons around from the north gate!

00:10:25.470 --> 00:10:26.900
What are you planning to do?

00:10:27.270 --> 00:10:28.600
I don't know, but...

00:10:38.550 --> 00:10:39.520
Get in front of the door!

00:11:27.300 --> 00:11:28.270
Wait!

00:11:41.610 --> 00:11:43.610
Go! Anyone will do.

00:11:43.610 --> 00:11:46.240
All we need is for one of us to make it to the power reactor!

00:11:48.490 --> 00:11:52.090
I'm sorry, but I have no time to be chatting today!

00:11:52.090 --> 00:11:53.320
I'm going to kill you.

00:11:55.130 --> 00:12:00.700
Madoka!

00:12:19.950 --> 00:12:22.080
Sensors are picking up Dynamis in the Turangalila.

00:12:23.090 --> 00:12:26.710
Each signal is faint, but we can surmise that there are ten or so of them.

00:12:29.060 --> 00:12:31.690
Attacking in full force? That's convenient.

00:12:32.660 --> 00:12:34.860
What's this? Is this...

00:12:36.100 --> 00:12:38.000
I'm getting an abnormal reading.

00:12:38.000 --> 00:12:39.400
There's an enormous amount of Dynamis!

00:12:50.010 --> 00:12:51.070
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:12:53.520 --> 00:12:54.580
Dad?

00:13:05.000 --> 00:13:06.160
Madoka?

00:13:48.710 --> 00:13:50.140
Go on ahead!

00:13:50.140 --> 00:13:51.110
Right!

00:13:58.050 --> 00:14:00.750
A tremendous amount of Dynamis is being sent from outside!

00:14:01.790 --> 00:14:07.090
It's penetrating the Lapis Warka and being amplified within the building!

00:14:07.790 --> 00:14:10.350
It's exactly like it was at the time of XX.

00:14:11.230 --> 00:14:13.920
It couldn't be... Enkidu?!

00:14:29.750 --> 00:14:31.780
Just as I would expect from the Professor's...

00:14:31.780 --> 00:14:33.580
But the game is ours!

00:14:35.590 --> 00:14:37.950
One of the enemy has entered the power plant area!

00:15:00.880 --> 00:15:03.150
We're in danger! Teleport!

00:15:03.150 --> 00:15:04.670
Huh? But...

00:15:19.860 --> 00:15:22.030
Madoka, we're counting on you.

00:15:22.030 --> 00:15:23.020
Right!

00:17:02.400 --> 00:17:06.100
I guess I'll say thanks.

00:17:06.700 --> 00:17:08.570
Not at all...

00:18:21.010 --> 00:18:23.980
Our work for today is finished.

00:18:25.180 --> 00:18:27.010
There's no point in fighting here.

00:18:36.260 --> 00:18:37.450
Wait!

00:18:42.800 --> 00:18:44.270
When did they...

00:18:47.300 --> 00:18:49.330
What are those?

00:18:58.280 --> 00:19:00.080
Let me introduce them.

00:19:00.080 --> 00:19:03.820
These are my Special Forces, the Blattaria!

00:19:08.530 --> 00:19:09.490
Disperse!

00:19:21.010 --> 00:19:24.380
The antimatter is being resolved into matter!

00:19:24.380 --> 00:19:29.370
If we materialize them, Gilgamesh, too, are mere flesh and bone.

00:19:53.070 --> 00:19:55.830
Their power is the presence of the nonmaterial within them.

00:20:35.810 --> 00:20:37.720
I didn't think I'd get through.

00:20:37.720 --> 00:20:38.650
It doesn't matter.

00:20:38.650 --> 00:20:41.050
I'm telling you, with all this, it's no time worry about work.

00:20:42.290 --> 00:20:43.290
That's true.

00:20:43.290 --> 00:20:45.760
Well, I'm going back home.

00:20:45.760 --> 00:20:47.380
Sure, see you.

00:23:31.490 --> 00:23:32.980
I have to go.

00:23:33.660 --> 00:23:35.120
They're all waiting for me.

00:23:41.470 --> 00:23:42.430
I see...

00:23:42.430 --> 00:23:43.800
That's a sad thing.

00:23:52.480 --> 00:23:53.770
Thank you.
